# Exact Mesa 26.0.0 libmesa inventory for the new src/mesa layout.
# Static entries follow the wildcard order in libmesa/mmakefile.src:
# main, math, program, state_tracker, then vbo; each directory is sorted by
# GNU Make's wildcard expansion. Generated entries retain the recipe order.
# The recipe appends the repository-owned mesa_sse_minmax_fallback.c separately;
# it is intentionally not part of this fetched Mesa source inventory.
